The Enkoan Trading Companies are headed by several houses, as the Head of the House equals the Head of the Trading Company.

These Houses with the [[states-general|States-General]] are the duality in the Power Structure in Enkoa. The States-General elect a Stadholder from these families.

## History
These houses existed far before [[sorrows-dawn|Sorrow's Dawn]] and [[bleeding-rivers|Bleeding Rivers]]. It is told that all four of these houses stem in origin from Wylan Seagrin, a legendary trader from the Lands across the water.  His sons would each inherit a aspect of his skills. They were Aric Thawnkoop, who would found [[house-thawnkoop|House Thawnkoop]], Beren Gaathenaar, of [[house-gaathenaar|House Gaathenaar]], Cael Kawoo, of [[house-kawoo|House Kawoo]], and Doran Ganzaryk, of [[house-ganzaryk|House Ganzaryk]].

